    "Description": "The ca-certificates package contains a set of Certificate Authority (CA) certificates chosen by the Mozilla Foundation for use with the Internet Public Key Infrastructure (PKI).\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* ca-certificates: Distrust eMudhra intermediate CA certificates due to security concerns (CVE-2026-114406)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
